:: Azure Square
<<initPlayState>>\
<<run World.setLocation("azure-square", "Azure Square")>>\
You are currently at Azure Square, the heart of Linkon City. \
<<if !World.isBefore(5, 0) && World.isBefore(11, 0)>>\
The area is teeming with life, as energetic voices call out to one another, and hurried individuals make their commutes to work.\
<<elseif !World.isBefore(11, 0) && World.isBefore(13, 0)>>\
People are crowded around The Café Corner, looking to get their lunchtime fill. Benches are taken as soon as they become available, and mumbles of chatter pervade your curiosity.\
<<elseif !World.isBefore(13, 0) && World.isBefore(21, 0)>>\
Children run past you, headed to Twinkle Toys. They must have just gotten out of school, you think to yourself.\
<<else>>\
The night chill consumes you, and gleaming lights surround you. As you look up, drones and their red eyes light up the sky, scanning for Wanderers.\
<</if>>

